  "content_description": "Action Item - Teams",
  "content_text_body": "People trust and have confidence in others who interact with them in a way that makes them feel truly understood and appreciated. The goal is for the team to practice being good listeners.\n\n### Great listening tips\n\nTeams that listen well show team members respect by acknowledging their unique experiences and honoring their individual points of view. Listening with sincerity demonstrates that team members genuinely care about each other as people.\n\nPractice these [Listening Tips](Glint_Leadership_Tips_for_Being_a_Better_Listener \"Tips for Being a Better Listener\") to become a better listener.",
